# Ignore generated benchmark results and logs in root benchmarks dir or scratch
*.json
*.log
results/

# Allow committed raw benchmark result JSONs under results/{sglang,trtllm}/
!results/
!results/*/
!results/**/*.json

# ...except the in-cluster Job's retrieval artifact. scripts/05_run_benchmarks.sh copies it
# verbatim to the canonical <suite>_results.json that the comparison generator and the
# integrity audit read by exact name, so committing both publishes identical bytes twice
# under two names. Must stay below the un-ignore rules above to take effect.
results/*/incluster_*.json

# ...and except the measurement-window scratch tree written by
# scripts/08_run_measurement_window.sh. Its raw deploy and teardown logs carry the real
# project ID and cluster names, and this repository is public. Curated result JSON is
# copied out of here into results/<engine>/ deliberately, never swept in wholesale.
# Also must stay below the un-ignore rules above: `!results/*/` would re-include it.
results/windows/
